{"data": [{"author_id": "1058501423653101574", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:17:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125005842324095367"], "id": "2125005842324095367", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1823248660601212928", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2125005672626434439", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dummerspast39 Meta Muse vs Grok Bot\n\nBe Honest.......?", "url": "https://x.com/LuminaBench/status/2125005842324095367"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2125004037967724544"]}, "author_id": "2006606438307966976", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:11:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125004282650862045"], "id": "2125004282650862045", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse: Set up memory before you talk to Muse.\n\nGive your AI assistant what it needs to know about you first, and every conversation after starts in the right place.\n\nFree weekly newsletter: https://t.co/eWDt15uLt0 https://t.co/Us7JeTDtIH", "url": "https://x.com/aiforchristians/status/2125004282650862045"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2125004049061904385"]}, "author_id": "2124789597448388608", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:10:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125004060038439100"], "id": "2125004060038439100", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Museに家計簿のページを頼んだら、約2分で完成しました。\nしかも作ったあと、自分で500円を入れたり前の月に切り替えたりして、動作確認までしていました。\n\n#MetaMuse  #Muse #AIエージェント #AIとやってみた #家計簿 https://t.co/5WMCulHygM", "url": "https://x.com/toji_ai/status/2125004060038439100"}, {"author_id": "1299805513371258880", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:04:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125002698915221647"], "id": "2125002698915221647", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2024: beat Google to using generative AI for test prep \n\n2025: beat Anthropic + Open AI to building a significant MCP marketplace for your agents to access &amp; act on your behalf in your apps\n\n2026: beat Meta (Muse) &amp; Instinct to running agents from your phone/iMessage\n\n2026", "url": "https://x.com/chanoouttathere/status/2125002698915221647"}, {"author_id": "829965333658152961", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:03:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125002418786308497"], "id": "2125002418786308497", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1460745393512361989", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124911879088988639", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ufobtc27 @tig88411109 移动互联成熟后头部效应就很强了，AI只是放大或者加速了这个过程。比如今年很多做c端agent的创业公司，轰轰烈烈却接入不了大厂生态，在我看来都是被Meta muse掀桌子的产品", "url": "https://x.com/backc01/status/2125002418786308497"}, {"author_id": "15891962", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:59:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125001385963843987"], "id": "2125001385963843987", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1951910595546198016", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 107, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124891016457249082", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@miniii_codes Openclaw is now meta muse?!", "url": "https://x.com/sergebl/status/2125001385963843987"}, {"author_id": "1827277799620751360", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:48:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124998627911483525"], "id": "2124998627911483525", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 79, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【WindowsでMeta Museを始めたい方へ💻】\n\n必要な方はご活用ください。残り 10 以上です。\n\n🎁Muse招待コード：YMRYOU 🎉\n🎁Muse Invite Code: YMRYOU ✨\n参加後48時間以内に入力し、条件を満たすと10億トークンが付与されます。", "url": "https://x.com/2abundant2free/status/2124998627911483525"}, {"author_id": "1827277799620751360", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:48:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124998576904589497"], "id": "2124998576904589497", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【MacでMeta Museを使うなら？ブラウザから始める方法】【画像付き】で解説✨\n\n必要な方はご活用ください。残り 10 以上です。\n\n🎁Muse招待コード：YMRYOU 🎉\n🎁Muse Invite Code: YMRYOU ✨\n参加後48時間以内に入力し、条件を満たすと10億トークンが付与されます。", "url": "https://x.com/2abundant2free/status/2124998576904589497"}, {"author_id": "1827277799620751360", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:48:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124998497049129060"], "id": "2124998497049129060", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【Meta MuseのMacアプリ】はどこから入手する？\n\n必要な方はご活用ください。残り 10 以上です。\n\n🎁Muse招待コード：YMRYOU 🎉✨\n🎁Muse Invite Code: YMRYOU 🎉✨\n参加後48時間以内に入力し、条件を満たすと10億トークンが付与されます。", "url": "https://x.com/2abundant2free/status/2124998497049129060"}, {"author_id": "1827277799620751360", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:48:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124998439159435737"], "id": "2124998439159435737", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【AndroidでMeta Museを始めたい方へ📱】\n\n必要な方はご活用ください。残り 10 以上です。\n\n🎁Muse招待コード：YMRYOU 🎉✨\n🎁Muse Invite Code: YMRYOU 🎉✨\n参加後48時間以内に入力し、条件を満たすと10億トークンが付与されます。\n\n実機でアプリの導入・既存アカウントへのログインを検証。", "url": "https://x.com/2abundant2free/status/2124998439159435737"}, {"author_id": "1827277799620751360", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:47:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124998382188118123"], "id": "2124998382188118123", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 55, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【iPhoneでMeta Museを始めるには📱】\n\n必要な方はご活用ください。残り 10 以上です。\n🎁Muse招待コード：YMRYOU 🎉✨\n🎁Muse Invite Code: YMRYOU 🎉✨\n参加後48時間以内に入力し、条件を満たすと10億トークンが付与されます。\n\nApp Storeの公式アプリ情報と、登録・初期設定の流れをまとめました。", "url": "https://x.com/2abundant2free/status/2124998382188118123"}, {"author_id": "1779476802135867392", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:42:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124996955428487601"], "id": "2124996955428487601", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1446406354956996611", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099397518111224073", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@zakiraicoder andychen@muse.ai", "url": "https://x.com/chenyousimon/status/2124996955428487601"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2124996259131846656"]}, "author_id": "1180424580944543744", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:39:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124996263611384260"], "id": "2124996263611384260", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 92, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "BREAKING NEWS 🚨 : Walmart is now LIVE on Meta @muse\nMuse can find Black Friday deals, build your cart and check out right in the chat with the card saved in your Walmart account\nYou set a spending limit and approve purchases in a new Walmart \"Agent Profile\"\nSame https://t.co/rz4yssbHUt", "url": "https://x.com/bruno_munhoz/status/2124996263611384260"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2123602672825909248"]}, "author_id": "772697385604567041", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:38:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124995910593654868"], "id": "2124995910593654868", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "MetaのAI「Muse」で自分専用のアドレスを持てる便利機能が、フリープランの利用客にも解禁された模様です（画面右下のアイコンからすぐに取得可能）。\n無料でも本格的に活用できるのは嬉しいポイントですね。\n \nhttps://t.co/GUiYpfmy64\n#Meta #Muse #AI", "url": "https://x.com/toshinobu65/status/2124995910593654868"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2124994112797687808"]}, "author_id": "139379248", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:30:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124994117101142493"], "id": "2124994117101142493", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【Meta Muse、ブラウザー経由で会話・記憶に到達。研究者が実証】\n\nMetaのAIエージェント「Muse」で、承認画面が出ないまま、検証用の会話履歴や記憶を外に送れたと研究者が報告。記憶の書き換えも確認されました。\n\n続きは↓（1/2）\n\n#Meta #Muse #AIエージェント #セキュリティ https://t.co/kQ6wq3sPb7", "url": "https://x.com/Naoki_Anzai/status/2124994117101142493"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2124993693845454848"]}, "author_id": "948359015704113154", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:29:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124993888125632523"], "id": "2124993888125632523", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI 早報 11/24 ☕\nGoogle AI 模式接上個人資料、Nest App 明年 1/25 關閉\nMeta Muse 逛沃爾瑪、兩州起訴 Grok 深偽，2 分鐘帶你看完 👇\n#AI早報 #人工智慧 #科技新聞 https://t.co/eeuNjalcR6", "url": "https://x.com/ang63488/status/2124993888125632523"}, {"author_id": "2051008727369789440", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:28:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124993610626301977"], "id": "2124993610626301977", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【余白ラジオ｜暮らしとAI実践便】\nMeta Museで自動予約！バックグラウンドVMで動かすAIエージェント設定術 💡\n\n📝 実践ブログ記事\nhttps://t.co/UqDJae5TqN\n\n🎙️ YouTubeラジオ（ロジ＆ラテ）\nhttps://t.co/EGkutNkRBE\n\n#余白ラジオ #AIエージェント #仕事術", "url": "https://x.com/CraftAuto_Lab/status/2124993610626301977"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2123601760925470720"]}, "author_id": "772697385604567041", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:22:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124991883881668782"], "id": "2124991883881668782", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Metaが提供するAIエージェント「Muse」に、便利なChrome拡張機能が登場しました。\nブラウザのサイドバーから手軽に呼び出せるようになり、日々の作業効率が一段とアップしそうです。\n \nhttps://t.co/8WNHCJC7r3\n#Meta #Muse #Chrome拡張機能", "url": "https://x.com/toshinobu65/status/2124991883881668782"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2124989668252868608"]}, "author_id": "1629583352754782210", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:13:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124989673886076958"], "id": "2124989673886076958", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 162, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This past season, I did some scouting work for the @OzarksLunkers. Now, I am here to help college athletes achieve their dreams and goals through the transfer portal.\n\nSend your film and stats my way, I’ll get you a report within a timely fashion\n\nEmail me nesportsreview@muse.ai https://t.co/FYEJq9CUHC", "url": "https://x.com/nesportreview/status/2124989673886076958"}, {"author_id": "521176576", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:12:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124989580739010605"], "id": "2124989580739010605", "in_reply_to_user_id": "8721292", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124969484364697800", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@mark_k Not really. For me, @Meta Muse is the one to use for personal stuff and Hermes @NousResearch is the one to use for the more serious stuff 🤷‍♂️", "url": "https://x.com/CommanderROR9/status/2124989580739010605"}, {"author_id": "3932104454", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:11:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124989319517741179"], "id": "2124989319517741179", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36,